ed in the \u2018Store\u2019 with real money. Chips cannot be exchanged for cash or be paid out in any form and can only be used to play our game. Blackjack is intended solely for an adult audience - gamers aged eighteen years or over.", "short_description": "Play SUPER FAST real-time MULTIPLAYER Blackjack now to improve your skills, gain experience, make new FRIENDS and become the best Blackjack player ever!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://intisab.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Intisab Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fb.com/BlackjackVR", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "999658334094237"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "519323532660303"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "519323532660303"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1628192280, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "519323532660303"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "36399420316372456", "version": "1.88"}, "id": "561605971491141", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typena